This is an independent re-creation of Snipes, the 1982 text-mode game by
SuperSet Software (Drew Major, Kyle Powell, Dale Neibaur, Mark Hurst), later
shipped with Novell NetWare as NSNIPES / NLSNIPES. No original code or assets
are included. "Snipes" and "NLSNIPES" are used descriptively; no affiliation
with SuperSet Software, Novell or OpenText is implied.

Game behaviour was studied from Davidebyzero/Snipes
(https://github.com/Davidebyzero/Snipes), a reverse-engineered port published
with the original authors' permission, whose copyright remains with them. It is
referenced as a git submodule under reference/ for behaviour lookup and for
the CI similarity check only; none of its code is part of this project.

Third-party Go modules keep their own licences (see go.mod).
